{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y在S03、S11等短段把不少感受拆成只在乐句出现的提示，稍一走神就容易错过；X右栏的短词总览更从容，也更方便回扫。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"平\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y用加亮短语把每段叙事的转折钉出来，感受又按音乐进程出现，因此人物从离开后的空落、反复自辩，到承认怀念与受伤并存、决定先把日子过稳，因果链更容易跟上。X的左右分栏更方便随时回扫感受词，但词组多是并列罗列；Y的细节更有先后、力度和身体感，前后也更像同一段心理变化。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9a82637d-c09a-4e30-ba55-ab4a7d4845f4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T231046829647Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.704, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:12:01.546524+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c939cc4918238cfa97f2c1a50bef75e8aa34b358e7c31278bd9ccd2791ba0741", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_ev